{
  "description": "Recursion tracer — steps through a recursive function (factorial/fib/hanoi): each call pushes a frame onto a visible call stack and spawns a recursion-tree node, returns pop and unwind; renders algorithm-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
